# Copy to .env (never committed). Only the api service reads these.
# The secret Mynt signs its requests with. On Mynt's hosting Mynt sets it for you each time the service is put online;
# it is never in the repository, the browser or a log. For a local run, any long random value.
MYNT_VENDOR_SIGNING_SECRET=replace_me_with_a_long_random_value
